  <section class="home-cinematic-hero">
    <video class="home-cinematic-hero__video" autoplay loop muted playsinline preload="auto" poster="assets/videos/hero-poster.jpg">
      <source src="assets/videos/hero-bg.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="home-cinematic-hero__overlay"></div>
    <div class="home-cinematic-hero__grid"></div>
    <div class="container home-cinematic-hero__content">
      <div class="home-cinematic-hero__copy">
        <div class="hero-badge" data-en="Bilingual IT delivery for companies operating in Japan" data-ja="日本で事業を行う企業向けバイリンガルIT支援">Bilingual IT delivery for companies operating in Japan</div>
        <h1 data-en="Japan IT operations, handled with clarity." data-ja="日本でのIT運用を、明確に前へ。">Japan IT operations, handled with clarity.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub" data-en="Thinkers GK supports offices, projects, users, infrastructure, and IT asset work across Japan. One accountable partner. Clear English and Japanese communication. Practical delivery on the ground." data-ja="Thinkers GKは、日本全国でオフィス運用、プロジェクト、ユーザー支援、インフラ、IT資産対応を支援します。一つの責任ある窓口、英語と日本語での明確なコミュニケーション、そして現場で機能する実務対応。">Thinkers GK supports offices, projects, users, infrastructure, and IT asset work across Japan. One accountable partner. Clear English and Japanese communication. Practical delivery on the ground.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" data-en="Request a Consultation" data-ja="ご相談を依頼する">Request a Consultation</a>
          <a href="services.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg" data-en="Explore Services" data-ja="サービスを見る">Explore Services</a>
        </div>
        <div class="home-cinematic-hero__signals">
          <div class="home-cinematic-hero__signal">
            <strong data-en="Bilingual by default" data-ja="英語・日本語対応">Bilingual by default</strong>
            <span data-en="English and Japanese coordination for users, vendors, and stakeholders." data-ja="ユーザー、ベンダー、関係者との英語・日本語調整に対応。">English and Japanese coordination for users, vendors, and stakeholders.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-cinematic-hero__signal">
            <strong data-en="Field-ready across Japan" data-ja="日本全国の現地対応">Field-ready across Japan</strong>
            <span data-en="Tokyo-based coordination with support across major business locations." data-ja="東京拠点の調整力と主要拠点でのフィールド対応。">Tokyo-based coordination with support across major business locations.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-cinematic-hero__signal">
            <strong data-en="Operational accountability" data-ja="運用責任を重視">Operational accountability</strong>
            <span data-en="Support, security, reporting, and lifecycle work delivered with follow-through." data-ja="サポート、セキュリティ、報告、ライフサイクル対応まで一貫して実行。">Support, security, reporting, and lifecycle work delivered with follow-through.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-cinematic-hero__aside">
        <div class="home-cinematic-hero__panel">
          <div class="home-cinematic-hero__panel-head">
            <span data-en="Operations Snapshot" data-ja="対応イメージ">Operations Snapshot</span>
            <span data-en="Japan-wide" data-ja="全国対応">Japan-wide</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-cinematic-hero__panel-body">
            <div class="home-cinematic-hero__metric">
              <span data-en="Support lanes" data-ja="支援領域">Support lanes</span>
              <strong data-en="Helpdesk, field engineering, cybersecurity, lifecycle" data-ja="ヘルプデスク、現地対応、セキュリティ、資産対応">Helpdesk, field engineering, cybersecurity, lifecycle</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="home-cinematic-hero__metric">
              <span data-en="Best fit" data-ja="主な支援先">Best fit</span>
              <strong data-en="Japan offices, regional sites, international teams" data-ja="日本拠点、地方拠点、海外チームとの連携">Japan offices, regional sites, international teams</strong>
            </div>
            <div class="home-cinematic-hero__metric">
              <span data-en="Delivery model" data-ja="進行の考え方">Delivery model</span>
              <strong data-en="Assess, coordinate, deliver, document" data-ja="整理、調整、実行、記録">Assess, coordinate, deliver, document</strong>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="home-cinematic-hero__media card">
          <img src="assets/field-engineer-dreadlocks-800x500.jpg" alt="IT engineer working in server room" loading="eager">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section home-control-tower fade-target">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-header-flex">
        <div>
          <div class="section-label" data-en="Control tower model" data-ja="コントロールタワー運用">Control tower model</div>
          <h2 class="section-title" data-en="One primary provider. A vetted fulfillment network behind you." data-ja="主幹となる一次窓口。全国の実行ネットワーク。">One primary provider. A vetted fulfillment network behind you.</h2>
        </div>
        <a href="why-us.html" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-en="Fulfillment Network & Trust →" data-ja="実行ネットワークと信頼 →">Fulfillment Network & Trust →</a>
      </div>
      <div class="home-control-grid">
        <div class="home-control-card">
          <div class="home-control-step">01</div>
          <h3 data-en="We qualify and scope fast." data-ja="初期整理とスコープ確定を迅速に。">We qualify and scope fast.</h3>
          <p data-en="AI-assisted intake + senior review. We translate business intent into clear operational scope in both English and Japanese." data-ja="AI支援の受付と専門レビューで、英語・日本語の両方で明確なスコープに整理します。">AI-assisted intake + senior review. We translate business intent into clear operational scope in both English and Japanese.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home-control-card">
          <div class="home-control-step">02</div>
          <h3 data-en="We execute locally." data-ja="現場で確実に実行。">We execute locally.</h3>
          <p data-en="Tokyo-based coordination with vetted regional teams across Japan. We stay accountable while the work gets done on the ground." data-ja="東京拠点の指揮と全国の実行チーム。現場対応の責任は当社が持ち続けます。">Tokyo-based coordination with vetted regional teams across Japan. We stay accountable while the work gets done on the ground.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home-control-card">
          <div class="home-control-step">03</div>
          <h3 data-en="We document and certify." data-ja="証明と記録まで一貫。">We document and certify.</h3>
          <p data-en="Chain-of-custody, destruction certificates, and executive reporting so your Japan operations stay compliant and auditable." data-ja="チェーン・オブ・カストディ、廃棄証明、レポートまで一貫対応します。">Chain-of-custody, destruction certificates, and executive reporting so your Japan operations stay compliant and auditable.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="home-control-cta">
        <div>
          <strong data-en="Primary provider. Single SLA." data-ja="一次窓口・単一SLA。">Primary provider. Single SLA.</strong>
          <span data-en="You never chase vendors. We stay responsible from intake to closeout." data-ja="ベンダー対応の追跡は不要。受付から完了まで責任を持ちます。">You never chase vendors. We stay responsible from intake to closeout.</span>
        </div>
        <a href="contact.html" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" data-en="Start a project" data-ja="案件相談を始める">Start a project</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

