            <p data-en="Day-to-day support, remote troubleshooting, account handling, and onsite follow-through when local action is needed." data-ja="日常サポート、リモート対応、アカウント管理、必要時の現地フォローまで対応します。">Day-to-day support, remote troubleshooting, account handling, and onsite follow-through when local action is needed.</p>
