            <h3 data-en="Hands-on site delivery across Japan." data-ja="日本全国での現地対応。">Hands-on site delivery across Japan.</h3>
            <p data-en="Deployments, swaps, installs, surveys, and coordinated work on the ground." data-ja="導入、交換、設置、調査、現地での実行支援。">Deployments, swaps, installs, surveys, and coordinated work on the ground.</p>
