  <section class="section section-alt home-signature-offers fade-target">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="home-signature-offers__header">
        <div>
          <div class="section-label" data-en="Signature offers" data-ja="主要オファー">Signature offers</div>
          <h2 class="section-title" data-en="The fastest ways to engage Thinkers GK." data-ja="Thinkers GKへ最短で相談できる主要支援。">The fastest ways to engage Thinkers GK.</h2>
        </div>
        <p class="section-lead" data-en="These are the clearest entry points for companies that need practical progress in Japan: urgent endpoint refresh, legacy modernization planning, and controlled AI operations." data-ja="日本で現実的に前進したい企業にとって、最も分かりやすい入口です。緊急の端末刷新、レガシー刷新計画、そして統制されたAI運用に対応します。">These are the clearest entry points for companies that need practical progress in Japan: urgent endpoint refresh, legacy modernization planning, and controlled AI operations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="home-signature-offers__grid">
        <article class="home-signature-offers__card">
          <div class="home-signature-offers__eyebrow" data-en="Urgent operations" data-ja="緊急オペレーション">Urgent operations</div>
          <h3 data-en="Win10 Exit Sprint" data-ja="Win10 Exit Sprint">Win10 Exit Sprint</h3>
          <p data-en="A practical path off aging Windows 10 fleets: audit, rollout plan, user migration coordination, onsite swap support, and secure ITAD." data-ja="Windows 10端末からの移行を、監査、刷新計画、ユーザー移行調整、現地交換支援、ITADまで一気通貫で進めます。">A practical path off aging Windows 10 fleets: audit, rollout plan, user migration coordination, onsite swap support, and secure ITAD.</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-en="Best for offices under refresh, move, or downsizing pressure" data-ja="刷新・移転・縮小対応が必要なオフィス向け">Best for offices under refresh, move, or downsizing pressure</li>
            <li data-en="Built around chain-of-custody and completion reporting" data-ja="管理証跡と完了報告を前提に設計">Built around chain-of-custody and completion reporting</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="home-signature-offers__footer">
            <a href="service-itad.html" data-en="Related service →" data-ja="関連サービス →">Related service →</a>
            <a href="services.html#offer-win10-exit-sprint" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-en="View offer scope" data-ja="オファー詳細を見る">View offer scope</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="home-signature-offers__card">
          <div class="home-signature-offers__eyebrow" data-en="Executive diagnostic" data-ja="経営向け診断">Executive diagnostic</div>
          <h3 data-en="Legacy Bridge Assessment" data-ja="Legacy Bridge Assessment">Legacy Bridge Assessment</h3>
          <p data-en="A paid diagnostic for teams stuck between spreadsheets, legacy systems, and fragmented SaaS. We map the current state and define the first bridge forward." data-ja="表計算、レガシーシステム、分断したSaaSに挟まれている組織向けの有償診断です。現状を整理し、最初の橋渡し計画を定義します。">A paid diagnostic for teams stuck between spreadsheets, legacy systems, and fragmented SaaS. We map the current state and define the first bridge forward.</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-en="Best for modernization planning without reckless full replacement" data-ja="全面置換に走らず、現実的に刷新したい企業向け">Best for modernization planning without reckless full replacement</li>
            <li data-en="Outputs a phase-one roadmap and budgetary next step" data-ja="第1フェーズのロードマップと概算次工程を提示">Outputs a phase-one roadmap and budgetary next step</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="home-signature-offers__footer">
            <a href="service-dx-consulting.html" data-en="Related service →" data-ja="関連サービス →">Related service →</a>
            <a href="services.html#offer-legacy-bridge-assessment" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-en="View offer scope" data-ja="オファー詳細を見る">View offer scope</a>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="home-signature-offers__card">
          <div class="home-signature-offers__eyebrow" data-en="Governed AI" data-ja="統制されたAI">Governed AI</div>
          <h3 data-en="AI Control Tower Pilot" data-ja="AI Control Tower Pilot">AI Control Tower Pilot</h3>
          <p data-en="A 30-day pilot for companies that want operational AI with approvals, auditability, kill switches, human override, and safe workflow automation." data-ja="承認フロー、監査性、キルスイッチ、人による介入、そして安全なワークフロー自動化を備えた運用AIを試す30日パイロットです。">A 30-day pilot for companies that want operational AI with approvals, auditability, kill switches, human override, and safe workflow automation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li data-en="Best for teams that need AI to stay visible and controllable" data-ja="AIの可視性と制御性を重視するチーム向け">Best for teams that need AI to stay visible and controllable</li>
            <li data-en="Built for Japan-safe deployment and bilingual operating environments" data-ja="日本での安全導入とバイリンガル運用を前提に設計">Built for Japan-safe deployment and bilingual operating environments</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="home-signature-offers__footer">
            <a href="service-ai-solutions.html" data-en="Related service →" data-ja="関連サービス →">Related service →</a>
            <a href="services.html#offer-ai-control-tower-pilot" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-en="View offer scope" data-ja="オファー詳細を見る">View offer scope</a>
