  <section class="section section-alt home-principles fade-target">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="home-principles__header">
        <div class="section-label" data-en="Why teams engage us" data-ja="選ばれる理由">Why teams engage us</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" data-en="A premium operator feel, grounded in execution." data-ja="見た目ではなく、実行で信頼される体制。">A premium operator feel, grounded in execution.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="home-principles__grid">
        <div class="home-principles__lead card">
          <h3 data-en="One accountable delivery partner" data-ja="一つの責任ある窓口">One accountable delivery partner</h3>
          <p data-en="Companies use Thinkers GK when they want less fragmentation between users, vendors, sites, projects, and reporting. We keep the work moving and the picture clear." data-ja="ユーザー、ベンダー、拠点、案件、報告が分断されず、一つの流れで進む体制を求める企業に選ばれています。">Companies use Thinkers GK when they want less fragmentation between users, vendors, sites, projects, and reporting. We keep the work moving and the picture clear.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="home-principles__list">
          <div class="home-principles__item">
            <strong data-en="Bilingual operational clarity" data-ja="英語・日本語での明確な進行">Bilingual operational clarity</strong>
            <span data-en="Requirements, updates, and next steps stay understandable on both sides." data-ja="要件、進捗、次の一手を英語・日本語の両方で分かりやすく保ちます。">Requirements, updates, and next steps stay understandable on both sides.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-principles__item">
            <strong data-en="Japan-aware execution" data-ja="日本の現場を踏まえた対応">Japan-aware execution</strong>
            <span data-en="We work around access rules, site realities, vendor rhythms, and local constraints." data-ja="入館条件、現場事情、ベンダー調整、地域条件を踏まえて進めます。">We work around access rules, site realities, vendor rhythms, and local constraints.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="home-principles__item">
            <strong data-en="Documented follow-through" data-ja="記録と引き継ぎを重視">Documented follow-through</strong>
            <span data-en="Status, handoff, closure, and lifecycle records are treated as part of delivery." data-ja="進捗、引き継ぎ、完了整理、ライフサイクル記録まで含めて対応します。">Status, handoff, closure, and lifecycle records are treated as part of delivery.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
